#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/bash
ROOT="$(cd -- "$(dirname -- "$0")" && pwd)"
source "$ROOT/lib/colors.sh"
banner "TERMUX CYBER DOWNLOADER 2.0.1 HELP"
cat <<'HELP'
START
  DL                         Open the interactive main menu
  DL "https://..."           Open menu with a URL
  help                       Show this help page (after installing alias)

SHARE MENU
  Share a supported link from another Android app to Termux.
  Telegram t.me links are routed to the Telegram downloader.

VIDEO
  Choose a resolution: Best, 2160p, 1440p, 1080p, 720p, 480p, 360p.
  Turbo mode uses yt-dlp -N 8 where the source supports parallel fragments.
  Trim asks for start/end timestamps and the selected resolution.

TELEGRAM
  Choose 1, 2, 4, or 8 transfer threads before downloading.
  After a successful download, optionally create a 1080p, 720p, 480p,
  or 360p FFmpeg copy. The original file is never replaced.

QUEUE
  Queue items run sequentially. Failed URLs remain in data/download_queue.txt.
  Edit the queue from the menu or with nano.

APK
  Direct APK URLs, APKPure, and F-Droid options are available.
  Only install APKs from sources you trust.

MOVIE / SERIES
  Search Google, JustWatch, or IMDb for legitimate sources.
  Paste a source URL only when downloading is permitted by that source.
  Choose a resolution and thread count before the yt-dlp download.

PLAYLISTS
  Use the dedicated playlist option. Each playlist is stored in its own
  subfolder under the Movies directory, with numbered filenames.

IMAGE & MEDIA TOOLS
  Download direct image URLs or social/gallery posts (gallery-dl required
  for supported gallery sites), save video thumbnails, and process local
  or downloaded images into crops, compressed formats, Expo assets, Web/PWA
  assets, or a PDF.

DEPENDENCIES
  pkg install git python ffmpeg termux-api nano curl
  pip install -U yt-dlp
  Install tdl and apkeep separately if you use Telegram/APK source features.
HELP
